
                       geant4-11-03-ref-07
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Make consistent use of the parameters introduced in G4FieldParameters
   in field classes. Added functions for accessing the field, stepper and
   equation types as defined in G4FieldParameters.
 o New class G4QuasiOpticalPhoton, a non-physical particle definition
   designed to encapsulate the conditions for generating a burst of optical
   photons in processes such as scintillation or Cerenkov radiation.
   Defined related processes G4QuasiCherenkov and G4QuasiScintillation.
 o General optimization of zoom behavior in visualization when using mouse
   wheel.

---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------


Summarised, the list of changes is the following:

externals/g4tools                                g4tools-V11-03-05
-----------------
- Removed obsolete tools::mem class and TOOLS_MEM blocks that use it.

geometry/magneticfield                           field-V11-03-03
-------------------
- Make consistent use of the parameters introduced in G4FieldParameters
  in field classes: extracted default parameters values as constexpr in new
  namespace G4FieldDefaults, so that they can be used in other classes as
  default parameters in functions declarations; replaced default values in
  G4FieldManager and G4ChordFinder with G4FieldDefaults constants.
- Added functions for accessing the field, stepper and equation types using
  the enum types defined in G4FieldParameters.
- Updated enums G4EquationType and  G4StepperType with missing constants
  with a comment that these equations/templated steppers are not built by
  G4FieldBuilder.
- Renamed StepperType() in G4DormandPrince745 to StepperTypeName().

global                                           global-V11-03-19
------
- Added model Ids and names for G4QuasiCherenkov and G4QuasiScintillation
  processes.
- G4VSIntegration: fixed bug in sampling of tail of a distribution.
  Removed usage of G4Log and G4Exp; improved comments to the code.
  Set limit number of iterations 100000 instead of 1000, which allows correct
  sampling of tails, preventing from potential infinite loops.
- Updated date and tag-ID for geant4-11-03-ref-07.

