physics_lists
-------------
- constructors/electromagnetic (phys-ctor-em-V11-03-12)
  o In G4EmDNABuilder, restored usage of Born model of ionisation in the
    energy interval 0.5 - 100 MeV. 
    Use Rudd extended model for light ions in all physics configurations
    instead of old Rudd model, which should improve CPU performance; in opt8
    configuration use the same models as in opt2 for electrons; increased
    low-energy limit to 11 eV for the CPA100 elastic scattering model.
  o G4EmDNAPhysics_option4, G4EmDNAPhysics_option6, G4EmDNAPhysics_option8:
    use fast option for a significant speedup of physics.
  o G4OpticalPhoton: added G4QuasiOpticalPhoton to support offloading of
    optical photon generation.

