- utils (emutils-V11-03-11)
  o G4OpticalParameters, G4OpticalParametersMessenger: introduced configurable
    options to offload the generation of optical photons for the Cerenkov and
    Scintillation processes.
  o G4OpticalParameters: added QuasiCerenkov and QuasiScintillation in the
